<p>Not a problem, thank you for filling this slot, it actually helps.</p>
<p>For the benefit of everybody else reading this: in 2015, long before the SCP-4XXX series opened up, I wrote a Tale, <a href="/introductory-antimemetics">Introductory Antimemetics</a>, which featured an SCP named &quot;Alastair Grey&quot; with the number SCP-4739. When the SCP-4XXX series opened up, several people tried to write Grey up as a &quot;true&quot; SCP, but did not meet with success. Now I hope we may be past this. (In my opinion, Grey doesn't need a writeup, the Tale is sufficient by itself, and more effective.)</p>

